The user wants to install GitNexus MCP server. The configuration they provided shows:

```json
"mcpServers":{
    "gitnexus":{
        "args":[
            "mcp"
        ],
        "command":"C:\\Users\\alilys\\AppData\\Local\\pnpm\\bin\\gitnexus.CMD",
        "enabled":true,
        "type":"stdio"
    }
}
```

This is an MCP server configuration for GitNexus. The command points to `gitnexus.CMD` in the pnpm bin directory. 

The issue is that while the config references the command, the gitnexus package itself needs to be installed globally via pnpm first so that the executable is actually available at that path.
